WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.833
Step 1: Use the search bar at the top. On a phone, press the search icon to expand it.

2
00:00:06.833 --> 00:00:14.583
Step 2: Type a page name, item or question, such as “how to make gourmet souvlaki”. Ordinary matches appear as you type.

3
00:00:14.583 --> 00:00:22.958
Step 3: Select a result to open its page, article or matching article section. Available image and video previews come from the accessible content.

4
00:00:22.958 --> 00:00:33.208
Step 4: For an intelligence search, submit the question with the search arrow or Enter without a highlighted result. A clear single match may open automatically; otherwise choose a result.
